<!--
  Option F — "A".
  The one that inverts the palette: a deep purple monogram on cream, pairing with
  ic_launcher_alt_f_background. A light icon reads differently on a home screen full of saturated
  squares, and a letterform is a different category of mark entirely from the rest of the set.

  Built from two slanted bars sharing a flat apex plus a crossbar, rather than an outlined glyph,
  so it needs no font and no even-odd fill. Feet reach y=74 and x=32/76, inside the safe zone.
-->
